      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, it is good to see you alive. You as well, Resha. When the Flight of Gorlack did not return, I assumed you all had perished to the wild creatures of this land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Karron, likewise! If only Vladnir had shared our fortune."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Indeed, Vladnir will be remembered. Vladnir will be avenged. Five new flights have arrived at your eyrie. Another seven will have made the journey within a moon. Next year, a full dozen more. Working together, we shall swiftly cull the prey-kinds that proved problematic. At last we shall tame this <i>wild</i> land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Yesss!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Karron, not even the whole of Morogor could subdue this land. Not in the way we strove to."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gor— ... ... never before have you spoken as this... Gorlack, by your own measure, you speak cowardice!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("My measure was wrong. I thought we need only escape Morogor to fulfill our reascension from exile. Yet we carried something of Morogor with us. Its fearlessness. Like our exiled ancestors, we fly pridefully along the shortest path. We cut down any creature we find before us, even one another. We become as one of the ancient foes — the Horde, the Jotnar, the Faerie... the Drakes. Until we are surprised by defeat just as Dominant Morogor before us. Because we shun all fear. That is why our noble Ancestors exiled us. Until we learn to temper our pride with fear we remain the creatures they exiled."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Enough of this glider folly! By your honor, Gorlack, you must return to your eyrie, to complete what you began!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("<i>This</i> is my eyrie now. Here I must stay to shelter my flight from the war that is to come. You may return with the remaining provisions we gathered. Once returned, you may claim the eyrie I forsook."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("You swore to aid those who journeyed to your Greatland! You called the hunt— Gorlack, the hunt is not ended!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Lisssten to Karron!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("My summons was never issued; the arrival of the flights was premature. My hunt was indeed ended, by failure. There is nothing more I can do for our folk now—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("You may embrace your cowardice, Gorlack. Hide here in your hovel with it. Yet your flight will not be dishonored by you. They will return with me to rejoin the hunt. To aid the salvation of our folk which you have forsaken! Through the Ways of Morogor, I Proclaim you Deprived."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("We are far beyond Morogor. Here its Ways do not apply."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Then only one fix remains... a trial to the death. Damn you for this, Gorlack. You have left me only the coldest choice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Gorlack, recall how we took captive the orc creature back in Morogor..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Agreed. We must do the same. Karron is to be taken alive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Before it set camp, I beheld a curious detail of Flight Karron. There were no gliders among them. Perhaps they were scouting... Yet burners too were absent. It may be two castes is all that remains of her flight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Whatever the case, Karron must not be underestimated."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Arinexis",
            x: 23,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            side: 2,
            facing: "ne",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arinexis%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arinexis",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:micro_ai",
            side: 2,
            ai_type: "return_guardian",
            action: "add",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Karron, you are only dragon left with ssscales. I choose to rejoin your hunt. Many of usss will follow you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("To think that such a small creature has more fire in its heart than my own kin... Very well, <i>little fledgling</i>, you have earned my respect."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("Arinexis, do not leave our new clan, it is not sssafe!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("There is no sssafety if we hide. My hatch–clan hid in Great Delta and was ssslain. You hid in Green Ssswamp with your old dragon. Your old clan was ssslain too. Will you do sssame again here?! We run, we fight and we live. That is only way for usss now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("I have ssseen too many moons. My feet grow weary and ssslow. I ssstay."),
          },
        ],
      },
