          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Karron, I banish you from this Greatland, from these far lands of the east. Not as the victor vanquishing a rival as it was in the contention... As a friend seeking to keep you from the turmoil that is soon to be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I strove to prevent a war between the flights. Yet I only traded that for a war of an unknown kind. The hungry flights arriving in numbers will call a hunt far greater than even mine. Yet this will not be a hunt... This will be a war with prey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Prey can no more make war on us than could the clouds."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("They already have, as we all witnessed. Perhaps half the coming flights will be scattered deep into the Greatland. Where they will meet fates unknown as it was with the Flight of Vladnir. Only through defeat may some learn the creatures they hunt are much more than prey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Verily, these creatures are fellow contenders for dominance over the world itself. With this Greatland as our arena. They are our equals until we <b>prove</b> ourselves their betters. In this Great Contention."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("We shall need allies from amongst the noble creatures of this land. Like our gentle saurians. So too the deep dwellers with whom we have now a pact. Our every move must be part of a grander design for victory. In this Great Contention that will take a thousand years."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("By this Windpath alone shall we reascend to dominate the world once again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, I do not feel this... Windpath beneath my wings..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Because you are still fearless, my friend. That is why I banish you west, away from this crisis. Take your flight west beyond even Morogor. Seek out new lands with the wisdom learned from mistakes made here. Let your gliders’ Spoken Memories guide the way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, let both our flights head west. We may together take on this adventure as it always should have been."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I am sorry, Karron. Our Windpaths shall never cross as you hoped. You spoke rightly before, I must finish what I began. When defeat drives our folk to seek a new Windpath, I must be here to provide it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("So it must be... May your fire light the way in darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("May your wings catch the winds to soar."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Karron",
            x: 0,
            y: 37,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Karron",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
